## 文化声明 Cultural Statement

本项目基于中国传统《周易》文化，旨在传承和推广易经文化。
This project is based on traditional Chinese I Ching culture, aiming to inherit and promote the culture of the Book of Changes.

使用本软件进行的任何占卜结果仅供参考和娱乐，不应作为重大决策的唯一依据。
Any divination results obtained using this software are for reference and entertainment purposes only and should not be used as the sole basis for important decisions.

我们尊重并鼓励对传统文化的学习和研究。
We respect and encourage the learning and research of traditional culture.